{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ba3c79d5-437d-8ab7-ae0c-622acfe7b2f5",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T09:49:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Helena Vieira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Helena Vieira. Calling about a pothole on my street. Big one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can take that down. What street is it on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Spring Street. In front of 451 Spring Street. Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "451 Spring Street. Got it. Can you tell me about the size of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Deep. Deep enough to swallow a tire. Car went in this morning, whole front wheel dropped down. Jolted me good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not good. So it's deep enough that a tire could go right in. Is it near the curb or out in the travel lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Travel lane. Right where cars pass, a few feet from my driveway. Hard to miss once you're in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is that a busy stretch?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:46:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bus route. Bus goes by every half hour or so. Seen it swerve around the hole. Not safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:47:04-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so it's on a bus route, and drivers are swerving to avoid it. I'll note that. Is there water sitting in it, or is it just open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:47:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Little water in the bottom. Edges are broken up, chunks of asphalt all around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:47:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, broken edges, some water in the bottom. Let me read back what I have. Pothole in the travel lane in front of 451 Spring Street, deep enough to take a tire, on the bus route. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:47:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:47:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Can I get a phone number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:47:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one nine seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one nine seven. Perfect. I'll send this to the street crew and they'll prioritize it based on the report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:47:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I get a reference number? For the report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, let me pull it up. [pause] Okay, it's coming up on my screen now. Do you have a pen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got one. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's PW, dash, two six, dash, zero four one seven. I'll say that again. P as in Peter, W as in William, two six, zero four one seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "PW, two six, zero four one seven. Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. If you call back, give them that and they can look it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Should I stay clear of it? Early morning I'm out back, tai chi on the back porch, so I hear the cars hit it. Loud bang."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you can hear it from the porch. I'll add that it's loud, too. For now, I'd go slowly and steer around it if it's safe to do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:48:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mrs. Vieira. Have a good rest of your morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:49:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
